WEBVTT

00:00:01.968 --> 00:00:05.768
Hajimari no kaze yo

00:00:06.206 --> 00:00:10.040
Todoke Message

00:00:10.443 --> 00:00:19.374
'Itsudemo anata wo Shinjiteirukara'

00:00:20.153 --> 00:00:20.653
The Story of Saiunkoku

00:00:20.653 --> 00:00:28.695
The Story of Saiunkoku
Ano toki yume ni miteita
Sekai ni tatteirunoni

00:00:28.695 --> 00:00:29.024
The Story of Saiunkoku

00:00:29.229 --> 00:00:36.431
Miwatasu keshiki ni
Ashi wo sukoshi sukumase

00:00:36.803 --> 00:00:40.933
Dakedo ushiro furimukanaide

00:00:41.041 --> 00:00:45.034
Aruiteyuku koto
Kimeta kara

00:00:45.345 --> 00:00:49.441
Miageta sora
Nana iro no niji

00:00:49.616 --> 00:00:53.017
Anata mo mitemasuka?

00:00:53.353 --> 00:00:57.346
Hajimari no kaze yo

00:00:57.657 --> 00:01:01.491
Todoke Message

00:01:01.895 --> 00:01:09.995
Yumeni kakedashita senaka
Mimamoru kara

00:01:10.437 --> 00:01:14.373
Maiagaru kaze yo

00:01:14.774 --> 00:01:18.574
Hi no hikari matoi

00:01:19.045 --> 00:01:28.477
Jiyuu no tsubasa de
Tsuyoku tobitatou

00:01:31.157 --> 00:01:33.250
On a dark night, the
first day of the month...

00:01:33.326 --> 00:01:35.794
...the selection ceremony for the
head of the Sa Clan concluded.

00:01:37.397 --> 00:01:39.297
After naming Kokujun
head of the clan...

00:01:39.365 --> 00:01:41.833
...the principal members of
the clan were arrested.

00:01:43.336 --> 00:01:46.635
Furthermore Sakujun lost
his gamble with Shurei...

00:01:47.373 --> 00:01:49.933
...and his life was on the
verge of ending.

00:01:52.879 --> 00:01:57.839
All Is Right With The World

00:01:59.719 --> 00:02:02.153
We searched but there wasn't
anyone in this area.

00:02:02.989 --> 00:02:06.254
Shurei. I'm sure you're
worried about Mr. Sakujun...

00:02:07.527 --> 00:02:09.791
...but there are other things
we need to do right now.

00:02:12.599 --> 00:02:14.567
Shurei?!

00:02:16.269 --> 00:02:18.237
We're the governors of Sa Province.

00:02:20.106 --> 00:02:22.074
Eigetsu.

00:02:29.716 --> 00:02:31.240
Let's go.

00:02:31.317 --> 00:02:35.310
We'll go and save Yushun Tei
and put an end to this disturbance!

00:02:45.865 --> 00:02:47.833
Shurei! Look!

00:02:52.872 --> 00:02:54.737
Mr. Yushun.

00:03:09.589 --> 00:03:11.955
Right on schedule. That's amazing.

00:03:12.525 --> 00:03:15.050
Ensei! We're going in
to save Lieutenant Governor Tei!

00:03:15.662 --> 00:03:18.825
The Sa Clan's soldiers are sure
to have the prison surrounded.

00:03:19.666 --> 00:03:20.633
Mr. Sho Sai!

00:03:20.700 --> 00:03:22.224
We'll need the help of your soldiers
from the Merchants Guild.

00:03:23.169 --> 00:03:25.137
What are you doing, Ensei?!
Hurry up!

00:03:25.939 --> 00:03:28.203
Now, just hold on a moment,
Princess! Eigetsu!

00:03:28.341 --> 00:03:29.933
I can't wait!

00:03:30.009 --> 00:03:32.170
If we don't hurry and save him,
Lieutenant Governor Tei will...!

00:03:32.645 --> 00:03:35.079
It won't be necessary
to go in and save him.

00:03:37.383 --> 00:03:38.577
Official Yu.

00:03:39.385 --> 00:03:41.853
What do you mean, "it won't be
necessary to go in and save him"?

00:03:42.722 --> 00:03:47.682
Yushun Tei is already out of prison
and is on his way to Koren Castle.

00:03:48.628 --> 00:03:52.587
Mr. Yushun is all right?
But, where is he now?

00:03:53.099 --> 00:03:54.999
Right there.

00:03:55.668 --> 00:03:57.693
He's right in front of you, Princess.

00:03:57.804 --> 00:03:59.772
Right in front?

00:04:15.788 --> 00:04:17.255
Yosen Sho.

00:04:18.424 --> 00:04:20.756
You were the one who
killed Enjun, weren't you?

00:04:21.828 --> 00:04:23.796
That's right.

00:04:24.230 --> 00:04:26.391
It would be easier for you to hit
me when I'm like this, wouldn't it?

00:04:26.466 --> 00:04:28.058
I'd rather have hit you
as an old man...

00:04:28.134 --> 00:04:30.329
...since there's a better
chance you would have died.

00:04:30.403 --> 00:04:32.371
You're a frightening
woman, as always.

00:04:35.508 --> 00:04:37.476
I knew it.

00:04:39.345 --> 00:04:43.111
That Enjun... would
eventually be killed by you.

00:04:44.217 --> 00:04:49.780
I knew it! That's why
I hated you so much!

00:04:50.523 --> 00:04:52.991
You were the only one
whom Enjun would look at.

00:04:54.327 --> 00:04:57.763
Only occasionally would he
turn back to look at me.

00:04:59.299 --> 00:05:03.633
But I was okay with that. It was good
enough for me just to love Enjun.

00:05:05.338 --> 00:05:06.896
Eiki.

00:05:07.006 --> 00:05:07.700
However...

00:05:09.042 --> 00:05:12.443
...I'm not kindhearted enough
to forgive your existence!

00:05:12.979 --> 00:05:16.312
You always, always interfered with
the relationship between Enjun and me.

00:05:18.685 --> 00:05:21.153
There was something that
Enjun said to me just once.

00:05:25.158 --> 00:05:28.218
I have a feeling that the way I'm
going to die has already been decided.

00:05:29.562 --> 00:05:31.530
Enjun...?

00:05:32.498 --> 00:05:35.365
Even when that time comes,
I would like for you not to cry.

00:05:36.636 --> 00:05:38.695
Because I will surely
pass away satisfied.

00:05:47.313 --> 00:05:51.340
Did Enjun... Did Enjun pass
away the way he expected?

00:05:54.987 --> 00:05:57.455
He lived as he wanted
until the very last moment.

00:05:57.790 --> 00:06:01.521
Is that right? Did he
say anything about me?

00:06:04.230 --> 00:06:06.357
That's why he was the worst lover!

00:06:08.101 --> 00:06:11.832
Enjun loved you.
More than anyone in the world.

00:06:12.338 --> 00:06:14.806
I know that without being told by you!

00:06:15.141 --> 00:06:20.135
It was because he was that kind of man
that I loved Enjun! I have no regrets!

00:06:22.448 --> 00:06:24.416
Live a long life, Eiki.

00:06:25.318 --> 00:06:27.582
I'll send you some
wrinkle-removing medication later...

00:06:27.653 --> 00:06:30.121
...popular in the capital
for being very effective.

00:06:30.923 --> 00:06:33.323
Don't let me ever see your face again!

00:06:34.460 --> 00:06:36.428
There's something that
I forgot to tell you.

00:06:37.130 --> 00:06:39.098
Kokujun didn't kill anyone.

00:06:40.166 --> 00:06:42.157
Makes sense to you, doesn't it?

00:06:53.346 --> 00:06:55.177
It will be daybreak shortly.

00:06:59.585 --> 00:07:01.177
But all things considered...

00:07:01.254 --> 00:07:04.223
...who would've guessed Official Yu
was actually Lieutenant Governor Tei?

00:07:08.060 --> 00:07:10.858
Well, as they say, "To fool your
enemies, start by fooling your friends."

00:07:13.032 --> 00:07:15.523
I'm truly sorry for
having deceived you.

00:07:18.504 --> 00:07:21.098
But how exactly did you
escape from that tower?

00:07:21.841 --> 00:07:24.139
To be honest with you,
I don't even know myself.

00:07:24.577 --> 00:07:27.239
I had entrusted the task
to Master Nan, but...!

00:07:27.747 --> 00:07:29.078
Master Nan?

00:07:29.248 --> 00:07:30.681
He's Ensei's teacher.

00:07:33.519 --> 00:07:36.784
I was suddenly struck
from behind by Master Nan.

00:07:39.859 --> 00:07:41.827
You were struck from behind?!

00:07:42.028 --> 00:07:43.996
My master is known
for his rowdiness.

00:07:44.430 --> 00:07:46.898
I was knocked unconscious,
and when I came to...

00:07:48.267 --> 00:07:51.361
...I had been abandoned in Kinka.
- Abandoned?!

00:07:51.871 --> 00:07:53.839
My teacher is generous, after all.

00:07:53.906 --> 00:07:55.430
I don't think that's the issue here.

00:07:56.275 --> 00:07:57.503
I was surprised too.

00:07:58.611 --> 00:08:01.341
I woke up feeling chilly,
and I realized I was in Kinka.

00:08:06.819 --> 00:08:07.444
Lieutenant Governor Tei.

00:08:07.520 --> 00:08:09.920
Were you the one who dispatched
the provincial soldiers for us?

00:08:10.523 --> 00:08:11.547
Yes.

00:08:11.624 --> 00:08:14.092
I imagine that the people who
accepted Chusho Sa's orders...

00:08:14.160 --> 00:08:18.119
...and tried to set fire to the town
of Koren have been arrested by now.

00:08:19.098 --> 00:08:22.295
The two Bald Eagles of Sa Province
are helping me out too, after all.

00:08:27.039 --> 00:08:28.768
With the head of the
Sa Clan decided...

00:08:28.841 --> 00:08:31.139
...the two provincial governors
safely entering Koren Castle...

00:08:31.911 --> 00:08:34.209
...and the town no longer in
danger of going up in flames...

00:08:34.280 --> 00:08:36.373
...we're able to welcome
this morning peacefully.

00:08:37.650 --> 00:08:39.618
All is right with the world, indeed.

00:08:41.621 --> 00:08:44.419
Heave-ho! Heave-ho!

00:08:52.632 --> 00:08:54.862
Chusho's trap has
crumbled and fallen.

00:08:56.168 --> 00:08:58.636
The long period of darkness
has come to an end.

00:09:03.476 --> 00:09:05.410
A new day is about to begin.

00:09:21.360 --> 00:09:25.126
I suppose my punishment has been
decided. Governors Hong and To.

00:09:25.998 --> 00:09:29.195
Now, in order to atone for the
countless wrongdoings...

00:09:30.002 --> 00:09:31.970
...committed by the Sa Clan, I shall
humbly accept any punishment.

00:09:37.877 --> 00:09:40.471
Umm... is it all right for me to
be walking around like this?

00:09:43.983 --> 00:09:45.951
You will not be
charged with any sin.

00:09:46.285 --> 00:09:49.186
B-But, if you think of what the
Sa Clan has done to this point...

00:09:49.422 --> 00:09:51.788
...it wouldn't be out of the question
for you to have me beheaded.

00:09:52.291 --> 00:09:55.089
If we had you beheaded,
it wouldn't change anything.

00:09:56.028 --> 00:09:59.589
Rebuilding the Sa Clan is what
you should be doing, Mr. Kokujun.

00:10:01.934 --> 00:10:02.901
Kokujun.

00:10:05.738 --> 00:10:08.298
I trust you'll do your best,
hand in hand with Shunki.

00:10:19.018 --> 00:10:23.978
The Story of Saiunkoku

00:10:31.964 --> 00:10:32.931
Grandmother.

00:10:38.204 --> 00:10:41.833
You must be busy dealing with
everything we, the Sa Clan...

00:10:42.742 --> 00:10:46.041
...perpetrated, so forgive me for
asking you to come all this way.

00:10:48.581 --> 00:10:50.549
What did you wish to discuss?

00:10:50.650 --> 00:10:55.417
I thought I should talk to you about
the truth of what had happened.

00:10:56.288 --> 00:10:57.983
The truth?

00:10:58.057 --> 00:11:02.357
To those who will guide the Sa Clan
and those who will guide Sa Province.

00:11:03.996 --> 00:11:06.021
- Kokujun.
- Y-Yes.

00:11:06.098 --> 00:11:08.532
Chusho Sa and your father are dead.

00:11:11.637 --> 00:11:13.002
Right.

00:11:13.072 --> 00:11:15.040
But you weren't the
one who killed them.

00:11:16.308 --> 00:11:21.712
I can tell that much. That you haven't
killed anyone. It had all been planned.

00:11:23.182 --> 00:11:25.150
By Sakujun.

00:11:28.187 --> 00:11:33.454
During that time in the cellar under
the shrine, incense was being burned.

00:11:34.527 --> 00:11:35.960
Sakujun burned that incense.

00:11:36.028 --> 00:11:38.292
It took away the mental capabilities
of anyone breathing it in.

00:11:38.931 --> 00:11:40.899
That sweet scent...!

00:11:41.033 --> 00:11:43.001
That's right. And then...!

00:12:11.864 --> 00:12:13.388
Kokujun.

00:12:46.298 --> 00:12:49.699
Contrary to Sakujun's plans,
that damn Chusho...

00:12:49.769 --> 00:12:52.397
...fell to his only son whom he had
always thought of as an idiot.

00:12:54.607 --> 00:12:57.667
Your father, even as he
took Chusho's parting blow...

00:12:57.943 --> 00:13:00.070
...protected you right
through to the end.

00:13:02.114 --> 00:13:04.082
Father did that for my sake.

00:13:05.117 --> 00:13:10.077
You haven't killed anyone. Yet you
tried to bear all of the responsibility.

00:13:12.091 --> 00:13:14.321
You really are just like Enjun.

00:13:18.664 --> 00:13:21.132
Enjun was said to have killed
all the men from the main branch...

00:13:21.200 --> 00:13:23.361
...to become the head of the Sa Clan.

00:13:24.003 --> 00:13:25.971
Everyone thought that was true.

00:13:27.406 --> 00:13:29.374
But that is not the truth!

00:13:29.675 --> 00:13:32.508
Enjun hadn't killed a single person!

00:13:32.978 --> 00:13:35.446
Old man Enjun didn't kill anyone?

00:13:36.182 --> 00:13:38.776
Then, who killed the men from
the main branch of the clan?

00:13:39.685 --> 00:13:43.485
It was one of the men from the main
branch of the clan, who admired Enjun.

00:13:44.190 --> 00:13:46.158
What?!

00:13:46.325 --> 00:13:50.694
That man committed murder in order
to hand the Sa Clan over to Enjun.

00:13:52.198 --> 00:13:53.790
Without a word in
his own defense...

00:13:53.866 --> 00:13:57.461
...Enjun took all the blame
upon his shoulders.

00:13:58.737 --> 00:14:00.227
Great-Uncle did that?

00:14:00.773 --> 00:14:04.732
But why did Advisor Sa
take all the blame?

00:14:05.845 --> 00:14:07.836
I have a feeling that
I finally understand.

00:14:09.515 --> 00:14:11.483
I've thought about it for a long time.

00:14:11.784 --> 00:14:14.150
The reason why Advisor
Sa started a rebellion.

00:14:16.255 --> 00:14:18.723
Didn't he start it because
he was seeking power?

00:14:18.991 --> 00:14:21.459
Yes. That's how it has
generally been perceived.

00:14:22.761 --> 00:14:25.059
But the truth was different after all.

00:14:26.332 --> 00:14:29.233
Advisor Sa didn't do it to seek
power to further his ambition...

00:14:29.702 --> 00:14:32.637
...nor did he do it to bring
Ryuki down from the throne.

00:14:34.039 --> 00:14:36.405
Advisor Sa cared very
much about the Sa Clan.

00:14:36.842 --> 00:14:39.470
Not only that. He cared
about Sa Province...

00:14:39.545 --> 00:14:42.013
...and its citizens more
than anyone, didn't he?

00:14:42.848 --> 00:14:46.909
That's why he wanted to rebuild it,
even if it meant risking his own life.

00:14:48.287 --> 00:14:50.847
Surely, he must have thought
about it for quite a long time.

00:14:52.091 --> 00:14:54.059
That's why, as head of the Sa Clan...

00:14:54.260 --> 00:14:58.959
...Advisor Sa had to start a
rebellion against the king.

00:15:00.199 --> 00:15:02.633
If the head of a clan were
to instigate a rebellion...

00:15:02.701 --> 00:15:05.295
...then the king could then investigate
the Sa Clan and sentence them.

00:15:05.971 --> 00:15:09.407
So he was trying to drive the festering
pus out of the rotten Sa Clan.

00:15:10.542 --> 00:15:13.272
Advisor Sa's rebellion was the
one and only chance for him...

00:15:13.345 --> 00:15:15.813
...to resurrect everything
from the bottom up.

00:15:17.082 --> 00:15:19.812
And finally, Advisor Sa's
hopes have been fulfilled.

00:15:20.519 --> 00:15:22.987
The illness that infected
Sa Province has been healed...

00:15:23.389 --> 00:15:26.688
...the pus driven out,
and the land has been revived.

00:15:29.128 --> 00:15:31.221
A new era has arrived.

00:15:33.399 --> 00:15:34.957
Grandfather.

00:15:35.935 --> 00:15:38.802
Enjun was truly a foolish man.

00:15:40.306 --> 00:15:42.900
But it was something that
nobody else could do.

00:15:44.009 --> 00:15:45.977
It was something that
only Enjun could do.

00:15:49.715 --> 00:15:51.683
I'm sorry, Enjun.

00:15:52.151 --> 00:15:56.485
I didn't really understand
what you were thinking.

00:15:57.456 --> 00:16:00.721
It's unlikely that I'll ever come close
to the level of Great-Uncle, after all.

00:16:01.393 --> 00:16:02.883
Kokujun.

00:16:02.962 --> 00:16:05.453
It's too great a goal.

00:16:06.398 --> 00:16:08.366
But I will swear anew.

00:16:09.101 --> 00:16:12.366
I will spend my life working hard so that
I can get even one step closer to him.

00:16:13.105 --> 00:16:15.335
Right. I will help you out, too.

00:16:17.443 --> 00:16:19.604
Oh, come to think of it,
Shunki. Kokujun.

00:16:19.979 --> 00:16:20.741
Yes?

00:16:21.714 --> 00:16:22.681
Hurry up and see a fortune teller...

00:16:22.748 --> 00:16:24.739
...to arrange for a lucky date
for your wedding night.

00:17:10.329 --> 00:17:13.093
- My lady, are you awake yet?
- Yes.

00:17:13.999 --> 00:17:16.467
You should prepare for the governor's
swearing-in ceremony soon.

00:17:17.369 --> 00:17:19.337
I'll start preparing right away, Seiran.

00:17:23.542 --> 00:17:27.137
I'm so sorry to make you
help me dress, Mr. Yushun.

00:17:27.479 --> 00:17:29.447
No, it's all right with me.

00:17:29.882 --> 00:17:31.679
Besides, it's better for Miss Korin...

00:17:31.750 --> 00:17:34.617
...to help Governor To prepare,
don't you think?

00:17:35.254 --> 00:17:36.380
You're right.

00:17:37.489 --> 00:17:41.755
Why on earth must
I help you prepare?

00:17:43.028 --> 00:17:44.928
I'm sorry.

00:17:46.965 --> 00:17:49.160
- Mr. Yushun?
- It's nothing.

00:17:50.035 --> 00:17:52.299
I was just thinking how that little
girl grew up like this.

00:17:52.371 --> 00:17:54.566
It makes me so happy.

00:17:55.574 --> 00:17:57.542
Have we met somewhere before?

00:17:57.910 --> 00:18:01.175
More like I was forcibly dragged
along by a couple of friends...

00:18:01.980 --> 00:18:03.948
...and secretly watched you.

00:18:17.329 --> 00:18:18.921
Shurei!

00:18:19.331 --> 00:18:21.265
Oh, looks like you're ready.

00:18:22.367 --> 00:18:25.268
- And it looks like you're ready, too.
- Shurei.

00:18:25.704 --> 00:18:29.538
- You're incredibly beautiful!
- Come on, you're exaggerating.

00:18:29.608 --> 00:18:34.807
In comparison... this fellow
can't even tie up his own sash!

00:18:36.415 --> 00:18:39.873
- Really, pull yourself together!
- Well, shall we be on our way?

00:18:40.185 --> 00:18:42.745
- This will not do!
- Please wait a moment.
Before we go...!

00:18:43.622 --> 00:18:45.590
Uh, hey!

00:18:46.325 --> 00:18:48.793
I, Shurei Hong, in order to
follow in both of your footsteps...

00:18:48.861 --> 00:18:51.022
...and fulfill the royal mandate with
which we have been presented...

00:18:51.096 --> 00:18:53.564
...would like to work with increasing
diligence and effort each and every day.

00:18:54.466 --> 00:18:57.492
Please kindly offer me your
guidance and encouragement.

00:18:59.071 --> 00:19:01.699
Likewise, I, Eigetsu To,
though inexperienced...

00:19:02.107 --> 00:19:06.544
...would like to put forth my best effort.
Please kindly offer me your guidance.

00:19:08.447 --> 00:19:11.314
You're embarrassing me!
Enough of this, you can stand up now!

00:19:11.917 --> 00:19:13.248
He's right.

00:19:15.287 --> 00:19:17.915
You mustn't do something
like this in public.

00:19:18.390 --> 00:19:20.858
You must be ever aware of the
differences in rank for officials.

00:19:21.326 --> 00:19:22.657
Really.

00:19:23.762 --> 00:19:25.161
Now, let's go.

00:19:25.497 --> 00:19:26.225
Yes.

00:19:38.644 --> 00:19:41.112
We're not exactly being
welcomed with open arms.

00:19:41.513 --> 00:19:44.107
Our provincial officials
are all stern-faced.

00:19:44.850 --> 00:19:47.318
Underneath, they're happy to welcome
two cute governors like you...

00:19:47.786 --> 00:19:50.880
...for a change unlike the previous
unsteady and unlovable governor.

00:19:51.490 --> 00:19:52.821
Is that so?

00:19:52.925 --> 00:19:54.916
Well, excuse me if I wasn't lovable.

00:19:57.262 --> 00:20:00.823
Governor Hong and Governor To.
From the bottoms of our hearts...

00:20:00.999 --> 00:20:02.091
...we declare our
sincere feelings of joy...

00:20:02.167 --> 00:20:03.429
...upon your acceptance of
this new position.

00:20:03.502 --> 00:20:07.370
From this point on, all the officials
within the government of Sa Province...

00:20:07.706 --> 00:20:10.072
...will support and guide the two of you,
as well as full-heartedly serve you.

00:20:10.175 --> 00:20:11.870
I, Shurei Hong...

00:20:12.077 --> 00:20:13.806
...and I, Eigetsu To...

00:20:14.746 --> 00:20:16.179
...will from this point on...

00:20:16.248 --> 00:20:18.808
...devote ourselves to being
the governors of Sa Province!

00:20:26.258 --> 00:20:28.726
- Wh-What?
- What's going on?

00:20:28.794 --> 00:20:32.321
Like I said. They are incredibly
happy to welcome the two of you.

00:20:35.367 --> 00:20:39.235
Finally, everyone's here!
Let's all do our best from now on!

00:21:04.296 --> 00:21:08.323
So you've finally returned.
Then it's over?

00:21:08.767 --> 00:21:10.166
It's over.

00:21:10.502 --> 00:21:11.560
I see.

00:21:15.107 --> 00:21:16.972
So it's over.

00:21:17.943 --> 00:21:19.911
The governors have arrived
at their assignment...

00:21:19.978 --> 00:21:22.139
...and the head of the
Sa Clan has been decided.

00:21:23.649 --> 00:21:25.617
Is he similar to Enjun?

00:21:25.817 --> 00:21:30.186
He's still far from matching Enjun,
but he is very much like him.

00:21:30.589 --> 00:21:32.557
He has the tendency to
be too kind, though.

00:21:34.059 --> 00:21:37.085
With that, Enjun can
finally rest in peace.

00:21:40.299 --> 00:21:45.327
Sho. You realize, I'll be dying before
you in the not-too-distant future.

00:21:46.204 --> 00:21:48.172
Don't say such an
inauspicious thing!

00:21:49.241 --> 00:21:53.575
Enjun and I lived and lived and kept
living for more than long enough.

00:21:54.646 --> 00:21:56.614
Even when we're gone...

00:21:56.682 --> 00:21:59.150
...it's not as though the time that
we've passed together will go away.

00:22:02.554 --> 00:22:04.419
Rest when you become tired.

00:22:04.690 --> 00:22:08.251
If you ever get tired of living,
Enjun and I will come to get you.

00:22:10.128 --> 00:22:11.925
It's a promise.

00:22:13.565 --> 00:22:15.430
We have a report from Sa Province.

00:22:16.234 --> 00:22:18.702
The swearing-in ceremony has
taken place without incident.

00:22:19.204 --> 00:22:21.900
Word is that they are both
well and doing a good job.

00:22:22.441 --> 00:22:27.344
Is that right? The future for
Sa Province is bright... perhaps.

00:22:28.313 --> 00:22:31.942
Knowing those two, I think
we can count on that.

00:22:33.118 --> 00:22:35.211
And they have Ensei Ro
and Yushun Tei...

00:22:35.287 --> 00:22:38.085
...as their assistants,
as well as Seiran.

00:22:38.824 --> 00:22:41.384
You're right. By the way...

00:22:42.794 --> 00:22:44.659
I wonder who will come on
behalf of Sa Province...

00:22:44.730 --> 00:22:46.459
...for the New Year's celebrations?

00:22:49.000 --> 00:22:51.230
There being two governors
of Sa Province...

00:22:51.303 --> 00:22:54.830
...it's likely that only one of
them will come.

00:22:56.308 --> 00:22:58.276
Is that right?

00:23:30.475 --> 00:23:35.572
Itsumo sugoku jiyu na anata ha ima

00:23:35.781 --> 00:23:42.118
Kono ame no naka donna
Yume wo oikaketeiruno

00:23:42.421 --> 00:23:47.381
Dokokade kodoku to tatakainagara

00:23:47.592 --> 00:23:52.689
Namida mo gaman shiterundarou

00:23:53.698 --> 00:23:58.101
Hitori demo daijobu to

00:23:59.638 --> 00:24:04.769
Anata mo watashi to onaji

00:24:05.544 --> 00:24:16.113
Tomawari bakari dakedo
Nazeka kono michi ga suki de

00:24:16.988 --> 00:24:22.585
Shiawase da toka ureshii toki ha

00:24:22.994 --> 00:24:28.057
Anata no koto wo omoidasu kara

00:24:28.934 --> 00:24:34.497
Iroazayaka na kisetsu ha kitto

00:24:34.873 --> 00:24:41.676
Kono omoi todoketekureru

00:24:45.050 --> 00:24:45.784
Next Episode

00:24:45.784 --> 00:24:47.786
Next Episode
All right, Eigetsu! Let's pull
Sa Province out of its slump!

